{"3372700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kim Jong Un Simulator", "steam_appid": 3372700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kim Jong Un Simulator is a reactive open world sandbox set in a satirized version of Pyongyang, North Korea circa 2011.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your father, the Supreme Leader, unexpectedly passes away and you are left to oversee the fledgling empire. Unprepared and inexperienced, you're left to discover and manage the sentiment  of your citizens through the use of gadgets, surveillance, informants, and propaganda.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's control through unabashed force, admiration through honesty and integrity, or manipulation through mass deception, you must ultimately decide your own leadership style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372700/extras/a58d9995232bebc5afab3e1b677fe8b5.webp?t=1772648604\" width=444 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kim Sim is first and foremost a sandbox, and how you choose to play in that sandbox will have a dramatic effect on the atmosphere of Pyongyang. The story, people, weather, props,  plant life, sound design and general look and feel of the world gradually shifts with your level of Corruption and Citizen Approval, among other factors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372700/extras/2e8710d25f0d57e9fbe23e36b29c2dd0.poster.avif?t=1772648604\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372700/extras/2e8710d25f0d57e9fbe23e36b29c2dd0.webm?t=1772648604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372700/extras/2e8710d25f0d57e9fbe23e36b29c2dd0.mp4?t=1772648604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372700/extras/4883407d02eb0cc84584945c3982e07d.webp?t=1772648604\" width=444 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Citizens in Kim Sim possess a number of different attributes that have an influence over their behavior. They'll remember the things they see you do and they'll form an opinion of you based on them. They may even share what they witnessed with other Citizens in their inner circle. You know how rumors go...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372700/extras/ca91e8a673dd2d20447f8297a2eb1efd.avif?t=1772648604\" width=282 height=418 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372700/extras/9e1b01c58cc2e2e8d8e04d9844f3e753.webp?t=1772648604\" width=444 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Citizens can be appointed to  Advisory roles where they can help unlock new policies. You'll need to make decisions about surveillance, security, immigration, news and propaganda, and more. Your policy choices can significantly alter Pyongyang, and selecting the right policy choices is essential when developing a strategy for Approval.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372700/extras/386efbea004dc3090eb265245a5185c8.webp?t=1772648604\" width=444 height=56 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative-driven characters with their own likes, dislikes, and useful skills, gadgets, and upgrades to impart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robust physical animation system that blends handmade animations with real-time physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visually diverse and dynamic day/night and weather cycles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles &amp; Traversal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Controller Support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kim Jong Un Simulator is a reactive open world sandbox set in a satirized version of Pyongyang, North Korea circa 2011.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your father, the Supreme Leader, unexpectedly passes away and you are left to oversee the fledgling empire. Unprepared and inexperienced, you're left to discover and manage the sentiment  of your citizens through the use of gadgets, surveillance, informants, and propaganda.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's control through unabashed force, admiration through honesty and integrity, or manipulation through mass deception, you must ultimately decide your own leadership style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372700/extras/a58d9995232bebc5afab3e1b677fe8b5.webp?t=1772648604\" width=444 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kim Sim is first and foremost a sandbox, and how you choose to play in that sandbox will have a dramatic effect on the atmosphere of Pyongyang. The story, people, weather, props,  plant life, sound design and general look and feel of the world gradually shifts with your level of Corruption and Citizen Approval, among other factors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372700/extras/2e8710d25f0d57e9fbe23e36b29c2dd0.poster.avif?t=1772648604\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372700/extras/2e8710d25f0d57e9fbe23e36b29c2dd0.webm?t=1772648604\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372700/extras/2e8710d25f0d57e9fbe23e36b29c2dd0.mp4?t=1772648604\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372700/extras/4883407d02eb0cc84584945c3982e07d.webp?t=1772648604\" width=444 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Citizens in Kim Sim possess a number of different attributes that have an influence over their behavior. They'll remember the things they see you do and they'll form an opinion of you based on them. They may even share what they witnessed with other Citizens in their inner circle. You know how rumors go...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372700/extras/ca91e8a673dd2d20447f8297a2eb1efd.avif?t=1772648604\" width=282 height=418 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372700/extras/9e1b01c58cc2e2e8d8e04d9844f3e753.webp?t=1772648604\" width=444 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Citizens can be appointed to  Advisory roles where they can help unlock new policies. You'll need to make decisions about surveillance, security, immigration, news and propaganda, and more. Your policy choices can significantly alter Pyongyang, and selecting the right policy choices is essential when developing a strategy for Approval.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372700/extras/386efbea004dc3090eb265245a5185c8.webp?t=1772648604\" width=444 height=56 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative-driven characters with their own likes, dislikes, and useful skills, gadgets, and upgrades to impart</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robust physical animation system that blends handmade animations with real-time physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visually diverse and dynamic day/night and weather cycles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles &amp; Traversal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Controller Support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Play as Kim Jong Un and gain (or lose) the approval of your citizens in this reactive open world sandbox set in a satirized Pyongyang, North Korea circa 2011.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372700/e7d43e1574009f3666c41b256cec5521bebed3c1/header.jpg?t=1772648604", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372700/d3c2fef19dbd04d2887c4536c536dda58d34a3e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772648604", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372700/d3c2fef19dbd04d2887c4536c536dda58d34a3e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772648604", "website": null, "pc_requirement